Activate virtual environment:
    source .venv/bin/activate

Local host testing:
    cd docs
    python -m http.server 8000

Then visit localhost:8000 in your browser to check images and layout.



To know if you have any servers active:
    lsof -i :8000

To kill a server:
    kill -9 16131

To load in https mode:
    python -m http.server 8000 --bind 127.0.0.1
